sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Browser Client
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP TLS
    participant KRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant Fastify as Node.js Fastify<br/>8080/TCP
    participant ModFed as Module Federation<br/>/_mf/:name/*
    participant BFF as Go BFF Sidecar<br/>(e.g. gen-ai 8143/TCP)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ExtSvc as External Service<br/>(e.g. Llama Stack)

    Note over Browser,ExtSvc: User Request Path - UI Loading
    Browser->>Route: GET / (HTTPS/443)
    Route->>KRBAC: Forward (TLS terminated)
    KRBAC->>KRBAC: Validate OpenShift OAuth token
    KRBAC->>Fastify: Forward + inject headers<br/>x-forwarded-access-token<br/>x-auth-request-user<br/>x-auth-request-groups
    Fastify-->>KRBAC: React SPA (HTML/JS/CSS)
    KRBAC-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>Browser: React SPA

    Note over Browser,ExtSvc: Module Federation - Load Remote UI
    Browser->>Route: GET /_mf/gen-ai/remoteEntry.js
    Route->>KRBAC: Forward
    KRBAC->>Fastify: Proxy to BFF sidecar
    Fastify->>BFF: Fetch remote entry
    BFF-->>Fastify: JS bundle
    Fastify-->>KRBAC: Response
    KRBAC-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>Browser: Remote UI module

    Note over Browser,ExtSvc: BFF API Call - Domain Operation
    Browser->>Route: POST /gen-ai/api/v1/models<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Route->>KRBAC: Forward (TLS)
    KRBAC->>Fastify: Forward + identity headers
    Fastify->>BFF: Route by path prefix<br/>Port 8143 (TLS)
    BFF->>BFF: Validate Bearer token
    BFF->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>BFF: Allowed
    BFF->>ExtSvc: Proxied API call<br/>HTTPS + Bearer/API Key
    ExtSvc-->>BFF: Response
    BFF-->>Fastify: JSON Response
    Fastify-->>KRBAC: Response
    KRBAC-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>Browser: JSON Response

    Note over Browser,ExtSvc: K8s API Proxy - Direct Cluster Access
    Browser->>Route: GET /api/k8s/api/v1/namespaces<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Route->>KRBAC: Forward
    KRBAC->>Fastify: Forward + user token
    Fastify->>K8sAPI: Impersonation headers<br/>(user identity from token)
    K8sAPI-->>Fastify: Namespace list
    Fastify-->>KRBAC: Response
    KRBAC-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>Browser: JSON Response

    Note over Browser,ExtSvc: WebSocket - K8s Watch
    Browser->>Route: UPGRADE /wss/k8s/*<br/>WSS/443
    Route->>KRBAC: Forward
    KRBAC->>Fastify: WebSocket upgrade
    Fastify->>K8sAPI: K8s Watch stream<br/>Impersonation
    K8sAPI-->>Fastify: Watch events (streaming)
    Fastify-->>KRBAC: WS frames
    KRBAC-->>Route: WS frames
    Route-->>Browser: Real-time updates
